    <string name="menu_about">ABOUT</string>
    <string name="about_text">Map: swisstopo vector base map, hiking trail network, Veloland and Mountainbikeland routes, closures (© swisstopo, © SchweizMobil).\nRouting: BRouter (MIT) on OpenStreetMap data (ODbL), profiles « trekking » and « hiking-mountain ».\nPublic transport: timetable of transport.opendata.ch (Opendata.ch) when connected; offline, the official Swiss timetable (opentransportdata.swiss, GTFS) packed weekly by the app\'s repository.\nMap rendering: MapLibre Native (BSD).\nSearch: GeoAdmin API; people and firms: search.ch directory (Swisscom Directories AG) with your own key.</string>
